From: z060142 <z060142@yahoo.com.tw>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 12:46:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 248/307] !B (Terrain Plate) Restore previous footprints during
 multi-plate moves.

Collect all plates moved in the same editor gesture before restoring any
footprint. Unwind the complete old overlap set once, then regenerate and bake
the group in deterministic cascade order.
---
 .../Geometry/TerrainPlateComponent.cpp        | 356 +++++++++++++++---
 .../Geometry/TerrainPlateComponent.h          |  39 +-
 2 files changed, 349 insertions(+), 46 deletions(-)

